\id RUT  
\h Rut 
\toc1 Ruth 
\toc2 Rut 
\toc3 Rut 
\mt1 Rut  
\c 1  
\s1 Vuyowo kaiwae Elimelek na le ŋgaŋga thɨ gara  
\p
\v 1 Va e mbaŋako iyako, mbaŋaniya giyagiya ghanji mbaŋa thɨ mbaro, dagabora i yomara e vanautumako iyako tɨne. Iya kaiwae amala regha rara Betɨlehem, Juda e tɨne, weiyaŋgiya levo na le ŋgaŋga theghewo, thɨ gara na wo vethɨ yaku vanautuma regha idae Mowab na vethɨ meghala vuyowoko iyako gheko.  
\v 2 Amalake idae Elimelek, levo idae Naomi\f + \fr 1:2 \ft Naomi gharumwaru “warari i riyevanjara”.\f* na lenji ŋgaŋga theghewo, idaidanji Malon na Kiliyon. Thiye uu Eprat, thɨ mena Betɨlehem, Juda e tɨne. Va thɨ wa Mowab na mbowo vethɨ yaku mbaŋa ubotu gheko.   
\p
\v 3 Mbaŋa inanji gheko Elimelek i mare, na Naomi mbema ghamberegha eŋge weiyaŋgiya le ŋgaŋgama theghewoma.  
\v 4 Ghɨmoghɨmoruke thiyake va vethɨ ghe gheko — thɨ vaŋguŋgiya Mowab wanakauniye theunyiwo. Eunda idae Opa na eunda idae Rut. Lenji yakuyaku gheko vama i wo ŋgoreiya theghathegha hoyaworo,  
\v 5 na Malon na Kiliyon tembe thɨ mareva. Naomi vambema ghamberegha eŋge vara, le ŋgaŋgama kaero nandereŋgi na le ghɨmoru tembe ŋgoreiyeva.   
\s1 Naomi na Rut thɨ njogha Betɨlehem  
\p
\v 6 Mbaŋa Naomi amba ina Mowab e tɨne, kaero i loŋwa toto ghambae gharɨgharɨniye utuninji, \nd Giya Loi\nd*\f + \fr 1:6 \ft “\nd \ft Giya Loi\+nd*” — Utuutuke iyake gharumwaru ŋgoreiye vaŋa lumo raŋa “Yahweh” o “the LORD”\f* kaero i mwaewo weŋgiya le bodaboda, na ghanɨŋga kaero veimaimava weŋgi. Iya kaiwae Naomi na oyawanyiye thɨ vivatha na thɨ roiteta Mowab.  
\v 7 Weiyaŋgiya oyawanyiyema theunyiwoma, Naomi i iteta ghembama va thɨ yakumawe, i reŋa e kamwathɨma iya i wa na ve raŋgima Judiya.   
\p
\v 8 Ko iyemaeŋge e kamwathɨ mborowae, amba Naomi i dage weŋgiya oyawanyiyema iŋa, “Ghemi themiunyiwona hu njogha e ghambamina na hu yaku weimiyaŋgiya lemi bodaboda. Ya naŋgo weya Loi na ne ghare weŋga ŋgoreiya ghemi va gharemi weŋgo na weŋgiya thiyema vama thɨ marema.  
\v 9 Na tembe ya naŋgo weva \nd Giya Loi\nd* na ne i vakathaŋga tembe hu lagheva na hu yaku weimiyaŋgiya lemi ghɨmoghɨmoru.”  
\p Naomi i mwanambiyeŋgi e ghareghare na i mwaewoŋgi. Weinji lenji gharevɨrɨ thɨ randa na ghalɨŋanji laghɨye  
\v 10 na thɨŋa, “Thava ŋgoreiyana! Weime eŋge ghen na ra wa weŋgiya len bodaboda.”   
\p
\v 11 Ko iyemaeŋge Naomi i gonjogha weŋgi iŋa, “Oyawanyiŋgu, mbema i thovuye moli vara hu njogha. Buda kaiwae nuwamiya weiŋguyaŋgiya ghemi? Ne valɨkaiwae tembe ya ghambɨŋgiva ghɨmoghɨmoru, thɨ thegha matuwo na tembe hu vaŋguŋgiva?  
\v 12 Mbema hu njogha eŋge, oyawanyiŋgu. Kaero yalaghɨsarɨ moliya ghino na ma valɨkaiwaŋgu tembe ya gheva. Na othembe thoŋgo amba valɨkaiwaŋgu ya vaidiya ŋgama, na thoŋgo ya ghena weiŋgu lo ghɨmoru gougouke noroke na ya vaidiya ŋgama,  
\v 13 ne valɨkaiwae mbowo hu dagetenɨŋga e ghe na wo hu roroghagha ghaghad thɨ thegha matuwo? Oyawanyiŋgu, hu ghareghare iyake ma valɨkaiwae. Budakai va i yomara e ghino i maŋga kivwala budakai i yomara weŋga. Kaiwae Lo \nd Giya Loi\nd* kaero i roghereiye wanaŋgo na vuyowoke iyake i laghɨye moli weŋgo.”   
\p
\v 14 Iyake i vakathaŋgi na mbowo thɨ randava. Amba Opa i mwanavatha yawanyiye e ghareghare na i ghawole, ko iyemaeŋge Rut i thovuvu Naomi.   
\p
\v 15 Naomi i dagewa Rut iŋa, “Wo u thuwe, len ghaghe kaero i njogha weŋgiya le bodaboda na weŋgiya le loi i kururu weŋgi. Ghen tembe ŋgoreiyeva, u njogha wein.” \fig Wo u thuwe, len ghaghe kaero i njogha weŋgiya le bodaboda|src="CO00956B.TIF" size="col" copy="DCC" ref="1:15" \fig*   
\p
\v 16 Ko iyemaeŋge Rut i gonjoghawe iŋa, “Thava u vavothaŋaŋgo na ya roiteteŋge. Mbema u vatomwe eŋge na weiŋgu ghen. Ne the valɨvaŋga u wawe, ya wawe, na ne the valɨvaŋga vo yakuwe, va yakuwe. Len gharɨgharɨ lo gharɨgharɨ, na len Loi lo Loi.  
\v 17 The valɨvaŋga vo marewe ne va marewe na thɨ bekuŋgowe. \nd Giya Loi\nd* le lithɨ laghɨye moli e ghino thoŋgo ya roiteteŋge; ko mbe mare eŋge vara ne i vakathainda ra meghaghathɨ.”  
\v 18 Mbaŋa Naomi i thuwa Rut le vothako, ma tembe i rovurɨghegheva e variye njoghawe.   
\p
\v 19 Elaelama theunyiwoma kaero vethɨ loloŋgaova ghaghad vethɨ vutha Betɨlehem. Mbaŋa thɨ vutha, gharɨgharɨ gharenji iyo kaiwanji na wanakau thɨŋa, “Mbema emunjora Naomi iya elaghɨniyeko?”   
\p
\v 20 I dage weŋgi iŋa, “Thava hu uno idaŋgu Naomi, huŋa eŋge ‘Mara,’\f + \fr 1:20 \ft Mara gharumwaru “maŋgamaŋganiye”.\f* kaiwae Loi Vurɨvurɨghegheniye i vakatha yawaliŋgu ghamɨnae mbema maŋga eŋge.  
\v 21 Va ya roitetake lo bigibigi veimaima, ko iyemaeŋge \nd Giya Loi\nd* i vaŋgunjoghaŋgo kokowaŋgu. Buda kaiwae hu uno idaŋgu Warawarariniye, na mbaŋake Loi Vurɨvurɨghegheniye kaero i roghereiye wanaŋgo na ya vaidiya vuyowae!”   
\p
\v 22 Iyake i woraŋgiya va ŋgoroŋga na Naomi i roiteta Mowab na i njogha Betɨlehem weiye Rut tɨnan Mowab. E mbaŋako iyako bali uloulo amba i wora eŋge rɨghe.   
\c 2  
\s1 Rut i kaiwo Bowas ele bali ghauma  
\p
\v 1 Amala regha ina Betɨlehem, ina Naomi le ghɨmoru Elimelek e ghauu tɨne. Idae Bowas, na amalake iyake iye giya vwenyevwenye regha.   
\p
\v 2 Rut, iye tɨnan Mowab i dage weya Naomi iŋa, “Thare u vatomweŋgo na ya wa e umako tɨne na va mbana bali iya rakakaiwoko thɨ ten na thɨ mban iteteko. The rakakaiwo ne ghare i njaweŋgo na i varaeŋna e ghino amba ya kaiwo e ghereiye.” \fig Ya wa e umako tɨne na va mbana bali iya rakakaiwoko thɨ ten na thɨ mban iteteko|src="co00961b.tif" size="col" copy="DCC" ref="2:2" \fig*  
\p Naomi i gonjoghawe iŋa, “U wa na vo vakatha ŋgoreiye, yawanyiŋgu.”  
\v 3 Iya kaiwae Rut i wa e umako tɨne, i rereghamba weŋgiya rakakaiwoko, na i mbana baliko thɨ roitetako e ghereinji. Rut va i minjanuwae, thela i wo Bowas, iye i mena Elimelek e ghauu tɨne, iya le bali ghauma i kaiwokowe.   
\p
\v 4 Amba ma i mwelumweluŋguya kaero Bowas i vutha, i ri Betɨlehem. I ŋaevairɨŋgiya le rakakaiwo iŋa, “Weimi \nd Giya Loi\nd*.”  
\p Thɨ gonjoghawe thɨŋa, “\nd Giya Loi\nd* i mwaewo e ghen.”   
\p
\v 5 Bowas i vaito le rakakaiwoko lenji randeviva iŋa, “Elako tabwako i mena thela e ghauu tɨne?”   
\p
\v 6 Rakakaiwoko lenji randeviva i gonjoghawe iŋa, “Iye tɨnan Mowab. Naomi va i njoghamake weiye, va thɨ ri Mowab.  
\v 7 Me naŋgo e ghino na ya vatomwewe i rereghamba weŋgiya rakakaiwoko i mbanɨmba reghamba bali rakakaiwoko thɨ mban itete. Me kaiwo wa mbe mbaŋambaŋa ghaghad mbaŋake, na mbe mbaŋa ubotu eŋge me roru e riburibuko na i towowe.”   
\p
\v 8 Amba Bowas i dage weya Rut iŋa, “Elana, wo u vandeŋeŋgo. Ne u ndewa e uma reghava na vo mbana baliwe, mbe u mbanɨmba vara e umake iyake. Mbe u yaku vara gheke weinaŋgiya wanakauke thiyake.  
\v 9 Mbe u njimbukiki wagiyawe vara kaiwoke iya e balike ghauma tɨne, iya ghɨmoghɨmoruko thɨ kaiwowe, na u ghambuŋgiya wanakauna iya thɨ mban reŋanawe. Kaero ma dage weŋgiya iya ghɨmoghɨmoruko na ne thɨ ndevakatha vakatha vatharɨ regha e ghen. Na thembaŋa ne mbwa i gharɨŋge u wa na vo mun e mbwako varivariye iya ghɨmoghɨmoruko methɨ gudurawe.”   
\p
\v 10 Iyake kaiwae Rut i kururu na ghamwae ve thukumwa thelau, na i dage weya Bowas iŋa, “Budakai kaiwae na u rerenuwaŋa laghɨye kaiwaŋgu? Budakai kaiwae na gharen weya ghawora loloniye?”   
\p
\v 11 Bowas i gonjoghawe iŋa, “Kaero ya loŋwevao utuutunin na ŋgoroŋga len vakatha thovuye weya yawanyinɨko mbaŋa len ghɨmoru i mare iteteŋge. Ya ghareghare va ŋgoroŋga na u roiteteŋgiya rama na tɨna na ghembako iyava madɨbanɨko i dobuwe, na va ŋgoroŋga na u mena na kaero u yakuva gharɨgharɨ mava mbaŋa regha u ghareghareŋgi e tɨnenji.  
\v 12 Ya naŋgo weya \nd Giya Loi\nd* na ne i giya njogha e ghen len vakathako kaiwae. Na modoko iyako mbala veimaima na ndendewo weya \nd Giya Loi\nd*, iye Isirel lenji Loi, na amalaghɨniye ŋgoreiya ma, e vineiye raberabe kaero menda u mena na u vaidiya vwarɨvwarɨrɨwe.”   
\p
\v 13 Rut i gonjoghawe iŋa, “Ghan thanavu mbema i thovuye vara e ghino, ghino ghen len rakakaiwo, amalana. Mo utu e ghalɨŋa udauda i mwanavairɨŋgo, othembe len rakakaiwona wanakauko thɨ laghɨye kivwalaŋgo.”   
\p
\v 14 Mbaŋa ghanɨŋga ghambaŋa, Bowas i dage weya Rut iŋa, “U mena ra ghanɨŋga. U wo bredɨke na u woutu e mbwake monyomonyoke.”  
\p I yaku weiyaŋgiya rakakaiwoko amba Bowas mbowo i giyava bali vwalavwala vavanawe. I ghanɨŋga na kaero valɨkaiwae, ko vavana vambe inawe.  
\v 15 Mbaŋa Rut kaero me wao na ve mbanɨmba bali, Bowas i rodage weŋgiya le rakakaiwo ghɨmoghɨmoruko iŋa, “Hu viyathu na i mbana bali, othembe i mban ŋgoreiya kaero yavayavathaŋgiko, ne hu ndeguva utu omathaŋaghad.  
\v 16 Mbala hu bigiraŋgiya eŋge bali vavana e mbambarana iya hu tenɨŋgina e tɨnenji, hu roitete na elaghɨniye i rombanɨŋgi. Ko iyemaeŋge ne hu ndedagetenɨwe.”   
\p
\v 17 Rut i mbanɨmbanɨvatha balima ghaghad varae ve ronja. Mbaŋa i wo umbwa na i ŋge baliko varivariye e wokiwokiyeko na i yaruvatha mbombouyeko, va i wo epa,\f + \fr 2:17 \ft Epa ŋgoreiye 22 lita.\f* raŋa ghemidima vethethiŋo ŋgamwara.  
\v 18 Rut i biginjogha bali e ghemba, na i vatomwe weya yawanyiye ŋgoroŋga baliko le laghɨlaghɨye me mban. Na tembe i giya weva Naomi ghanɨŋgama me ghanɨvarema.  
\v 19 Yawanyiye i vaito iŋa, “Noroke aŋga mo mbana bali? Thela ele bali ghauma mo kaiwowe? Ya naŋgo na Loi mbala i mwaewo weya giyako iyako iya me thalavuŋgena noroke.”  
\p Rut i dage weya yawanyiye iŋa, “Amalako iya ma kaiwo ele umako tɨne idae Bowas.”   
\p
\v 20 Naomi i dagewe iŋa, “Ya naŋgo \nd Giya Loi\nd* iye ghare weŋgiya thavala e yawayawalinji na ramaremare ma mbaŋa regha iko, i mwaewo weya amalako iyako.” Na mbowo i gotubweva iŋa, “Amalana iyena la boda regha na iye ŋgoreiya ghanda rathalavu, valɨkaiwae ne i njimbukikinda.”   
\p
\v 21 Rut iŋa, “Na tembe me dageva e ghino na iŋa, ‘Mbe u mena u kakaiwo vara weinaŋgiya lo rakakaiwoke ghaghad thɨ uloulovao elo balike.’”   
\p
\v 22 Naomi i dage weya yawanyiye Rut iŋa, “Ŋgoreiye, wou yawanyiŋgu, mbala ma rakakaiwo e bali ghanji umauma vavana thɨ mena thɨ vakatha vuyowo e ghen, thoŋgo kaero u wava e bali ghauma reghava. I thovuye moli mbe u kaiwo vara weinaŋgiya wanakauna iya Bowas ele balina ghauma tɨne.”   
\p
\v 23 Iya kaiwae Rut mbe i kakaiwo vara e baliko ghauma tɨne. Mbe ina vara rakakaiwoko wanakauko evasiwanji ghaghad thɨ uloulovao bali na wit. Na Rut mbe i yaku vara weiye yawanyiye.   
\c 3  
\s1 Rut i naŋgo weya Bowas na i thalavu elaghɨniye na Naomi  
\p
\v 1 Va mbaŋa regha amba Naomi i dage weya yawanyiye Rut iŋa, “Wo ya tamweya kamwathɨ na thoŋgo valɨkaiwaŋgu ya tuthiya ghɨmoru regha na u vaŋgu mbala len yakuyaku i thovuye na wein len warari.  
\v 2 U renuwaŋakikiya Bowas, iya mendava vo kaiwo weinaŋgiya le rakakaiwo wanakauma. Iye ghanda rathalavu la ghɨmoru ghanjiuu loloniye.\f + \fr 3:2 \ft Vaŋa lumo raŋa “clansman redeemer”.\f* Wo u vandeŋeŋgo. Noroke gougou ina balima ghaghamba vwaravwara i vwara balima na i ghetha varivariye na ndamwandamwa weiye mbombouye.  
\v 3 Iya kaiwae nuwaŋguiya u thithu, u ghavatha na u worawa bunama e riwan. U njimbo kwama thovuye, amba u wa ŋgora i vwaravwara na i ghetha balikowe, ko iyemaeŋge mbaŋa ne inan gheko mbe u vakatha wagiyaweŋge vara na thava i ghareghareŋge ghaghad ne munumu na ghanɨŋga e ghereiye.  
\v 4 U njimbu vakatha mbaŋa ne ve ghena. Mbala u wa na vo ronja evasiwae, u livaira thogana e gheghena na u ghena evasiwae. Tene i dage e ghen ŋgoroŋga ne u vakatha na uŋa.”   
\p
\v 5 Rut i gonjoghawe iŋa, “Ne ya vakatha ŋgoreiya mo utuŋana.”  
\v 6 Kaero Rut i wareri i wa e ghamba vwaravwara bali na i vakatha ŋgoreiya yawanyiye me utumawe.   
\p
\v 7 Mbaŋa Bowas i ghanɨvao na i munɨvao, ghare i warari laghɨye. I wa ŋgoreiya baliko ghawabwi ghadidiye na ve ghenawe. Rut tembe seiwo seiwo vara i wawe, i tatethara gheghe kaero i ghena.  
\v 8 Mbala vama i wo gougou mborowae, amba Bowas i raraghana ghare, i ghenevaghɨle na mara i wa e gheghe, ghare i yo mbaŋa i thuwa wevo eunda i ghena e gheghe. \fig Rut tembe seiwo seiwo vara i wawe, i tatethara gheghe kaero i ghena|src="Ruth3.1.tif" size="col" copy="LRec" ref="3:7" \fig*   
\p
\v 9 Bowas i vaito iŋa, “Thela ghen?”  
\p I gonjoghawe iŋa, “Ghino Rut, len rakakaiwo. Kaiwae ghɨmoruko va ya vaŋgukaiko le boda ghen na ghen ghamarathalavu valɨkaiwae tembe u njimbukikiŋgova.”\f + \fr 3:9 \ft Rut va iŋa, “Mbema u vaŋguŋgo eŋge.” Ko iyemaeŋge vaŋa Hibru iŋa, “Mbema u livagumoŋgo e ghan kwamana mbothiye e vwataŋguke.”\f*   
\p
\v 10 I gonjoghawe iŋa, “Ya naŋgo weya \nd Giya Loi\nd* na i mwaewo e ghen, elana. Ghan thanavuke iya u vakathake e ghino noroke i kivwala ghan thanavu iya u vakavakatha weya yawanyinɨna. Ma mo tamweya ghɨmoru amba thegha ndamwandamwa na nuwaniya u vaŋgu, othembe i vwenyevwenye o mbinyembinyeŋgu?  
\v 11 Ko mbaŋake, Rut, thava u gharelaghɨlaghɨ, kaiwae gharɨgharɨko wolaghɨye e ghembako thɨ ghareghare euriya ghen na ghino ne ya vakatha bigibigike wolaghɨye kaiwan.  
\v 12 Emunjora ghino lo boda iya ghɨmoruna va u vaŋgukaina na mbaro iŋa ghino ya njimbukikiŋge, ko iyemaeŋge ghɨmoru regha yawanyinɨna le boda na iye ma i bwagabwaga moli e ghen ŋgoreiya ghino.  
\v 13 Mbowo u yaku vara gheke gougouke iyake na ne mbaŋambaŋa amba vara thuwe na ra vanamwe weinda. Thoŋgo le renuwaŋa ŋgoreiye na i varaeŋna i njimbukikiŋge, i thovuye; ko thoŋgo ma le renuwaŋa ŋgoreiye, ya dagerawe \nd Giya Loi\nd* e marae, ne ya wo vuyowoko iyako. Iya kaiwae u ghena vara gheke ghaghad ne ighɨviya.”   
\p
\v 14 Rut mbowo i ghena gheko ghaghad ighɨviya rakaraka, ko iyemaeŋge va i thuweiru amba maramomouwo na mbala ma lolo regha i thuwe, kaiwae Bowas maŋa ma nuwaiya lolo regha i ghareghare mena gheko.   
\p
\v 15 Bowas i dagewe iŋa, “U liraŋgiya ghan kwamana ghayaboyabo na u livamomoya gheke.” I vakatha ŋgoreiye, amba Bowas i liŋgiya bali e tɨne, le vuyovuyowo mbalavama 30 kilogram. I thalavu i thɨnɨvairɨ amba amalaghɨniye i njogha e ghembako tɨne.   
\p
\v 16 Mbaŋa Rut i njoghama weya yawanyiye, kaero yawanyiye i vaito iŋa, “Ŋgoroŋga me le vakatha e ghen, elana?”  
\p Rut i utugiyavaowe bigibigiko wolaghɨye Bowas me le vakathakowe.  
\v 17 I gotubwe iŋa, “Na balike i laghɨye moli ŋgoreiye vara iyake me giya weŋgo na iŋa thava ya njoghama e ghen kokowaŋgu.”   
\p
\v 18 Naomi i gonjoghawe iŋa, “Rut, tha u rerenuwaŋa, mbema u yaku eŋge na u roroghagha ŋgoroŋga ne une ve yomara. Bowas mane i yaku noroke ghaghad ne ve vanamwe renuwaŋana iyana.”   
\c 4  
\s1 Bowas i vaŋgu Rut  
\p
\v 1 Amba Bowas i wa ŋgoreiye ghembako ghaghambaru, iye ghamba mevathavatha, na ve yakuwe. Amba Elimelek le bodama iya i rothɨgha amalaghɨniye, amalama Bowas me utuŋa utuniyema, i mena e ghadidiye, na Bowas i dagewe iŋa, “Amalana, wo u mena u yaku gheke.” I wa iyena kaero ve ronja.   
\p
\v 2 Bowas i vaŋguvathaŋgiva ghembako gharandeviva theyaworo na vethɨ yayaku gheko weinjiyaŋgi.  
\v 3 Amba i dage weya le bodama iŋa, “Kaiwae Naomi kaero menda i njoghama Mowab e tɨne, nuwaiya i vakuneŋa thelau vuvura, iya la bodama Elimelek va i mare itetema.  
\v 4 Ma renuwaŋa valɨkaiwae u ghareghareya iyake iya kaiwae ma womena renuwaŋa iyake e ghen. Mbaŋake iyake thoŋgo nuwaniya u vamodonjogha randevivaŋgike thiyake e maranji. Ko thoŋgo ma nuwaniya, u woveŋgoma len renuwaŋa, kaiwae vavamodonjogha ele valɨvaŋga i viva moli ghen ko amba ghino.”  
\p Amalama i gonjoghawe iŋa, “Ne ya vamodonjogha.”   
\p
\v 5 Ko amba Bowas i dagewe iŋa, “The mbaŋa ne u vamodanjogha thelauko iyako, kaero ŋgoreiye ne u vaŋgwa Rut iye wambwi tɨnan Mowab na len wevo, na mbala hu ghambɨŋgiya gamagai wein na thelauna iyena i yaku weŋgiya ghembwiyena le ŋgaŋga.”   
\p
\v 6 Amalako i gonjoghawe iŋa, “Kaiwae ŋgoreiyeva iyana, ma valɨkaiwaŋgu ya vakatha ŋgoreiya la boda vakavakathaniye kaiwae ne i vakathaŋge na iwaeŋge lo ghamba mbaro ma i laghɨye. Ghen eŋge u vamodonjogha; ghino ma valɨkaiwaŋgu.”   
\p
\v 7 Me vivako Isirel gharɨgharɨniye me lenji vakatha ŋgoreiyake mbaŋa methɨ vakuneŋa o thɨ vegiya weŋgiya bigibigi: ravavakune iye ne i bigiraŋgiya gheghe ghae na i giya weya ravavamodo. Iyake va ghanji thanavu na i vaemunjoruŋa renuwaŋako iyako kaero thɨ vanamwe.   
\p
\v 8 Kaiwae ŋgoreiyako, mbaŋa amalako iŋa, “U vamodanjogha,” i bigiraŋgiya gheghe ghae na i giya weya Bowas.   
\p
\v 9 Amba Bowas i dage weŋgiya randevivaŋgiko na thavalava va inanji gheko iŋa, “Noroke taulaghɨna ghemi e marami kaero ne ya vamodonjogha bigibigiko wolaghɨye weya Naomi; Elimelek le bigibigi na tembe ŋgoreiyeva Kiliyon na Malon lenji bigibigi.  
\v 10 Tembe ŋgoreiyeva Rut iye tɨnan Mowab, Malon ghembwiye, iye kaero lo wevo. Iya kaiwae bigibigiko wolaghɨye mbene i yaku wevara Malon le ŋgaŋga, na Elimelek gheuuko mbala mbe i mbuthumbuthu vara e ghabodako tɨnenji e ghambaeko. Ghemi ne hu utuŋa utuutuke iyake weŋgiya gharɨgharɨke wolaghɨye.”   
\p
\v 11 Randevivaŋgiko na vavanava thɨŋa, “Ŋgoreiye, ghime wo thuwe na ne wo utuŋa. Wo naŋgo weya \nd Giya Loi\nd* na ne i vakatha wevona iyana, iya i mena e len ŋgolona na nevole ŋgoreiya Reitiyel na Leya, thiye wabwi Isirel otɨnatɨnanji. Tembe wo naŋgo weva \nd Giya Loi\nd* na mbala i vakathaŋge na u vwenyevwenye uu Eprat e tɨne na giya vwenyevwenye ghen Betɨlehem e tɨne.  
\v 12 \nd Giya Loi\nd* ne i vakatha wevoko iyako na ne hu ghamba gamagai na ne thɨ vakatha ghanuuna idae laghɨye ŋgoreiya Peres gheuu, Juda na Tamar narinji.”   
\s1 Deivid orumburumbuye  
\p
\v 13 Iyako e ghereiye Bowas i vaŋgwa Rut na levo. Bowas i ghenethaiya levo Rut na \nd Giya Loi\nd* i mwaewowe i vaidiya ŋgama. I ghambɨkaiya ŋgama ghɨmoru.  
\v 14 Wanakau Betɨlehem e tɨne thɨ dage weya Naomi thɨŋa, “Taulaghɨke ghinda ra tarawe \nd Giya Loi\nd*, kaiwae kaero le renuwaŋa ŋgoreiye na noroke rumbun ŋgama ghɨmoru, iye nevole i njimbukikiŋge. Wo naŋgo weya \nd Giya Loi\nd* na ŋgamana iyena nevole idae i laghɨye Isirel gharɨgharɨniye e tɨnenji.  
\v 15 Yawanyin na valɨghareghare mbe ghare vara e ghen, na le vakathako iyako e ghen i kaitotowo, i kivwala wevo i ghambɨŋgiya gamagai ghɨmoghɨmoru theghepirɨ. Na kaero ne i ghamba ŋgama ghɨmoru kaiwan, na iye nevole i njimbukikiŋge mbaŋa nevolema u yalaghɨsarɨ moli.”   
\p
\v 16 Amba Naomi i wo ŋgamako e nɨmanɨmaeko, i mwanambiye e ghareghare na mbe gharewe vara.  
\v 17 Wanakauko e ghembako iyako tɨne thɨŋa, “Naomi kaero rumbuye ŋgama ghɨmoru.” Thɨ rena idae Obedi. Iye Jese ramae na Deivid ramaya Jese. \fig Naomi i wo ŋgamako e nɨmanɨmaeko|src="co00975b.tif" size="col" copy="DCC" ref="4:16" \fig*   
\p
\v 18 Gharɨgharɨke thiyake Deivid orumburumbuye, i ri weya Peres i mena ghaghad Deivid:  
\b  
\li1 Peres nariya Hesron,   
\li1
\v 19 Hesron nariya Ram,  
\li1 Ram nariya Aminadab,   
\li1
\v 20 Aminadab nariya Nason,  
\li1 Nason nariya Salmon,   
\li1
\v 21 Salmon nariya Bowas,  
\li1 Bowas nariya Obedi,   
\li1
\v 22 Obedi nariya Jese,  
\li1 Jese nariya Deivid.   